---
layout: base.njk
title: Pricing - Transparent Marketing Packages
description: Honest, transparent pricing for digital marketing services in Boston. No hidden fees, no annual contracts. Plans starting at $2,500/month.
---

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-inner hero-solo">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow reveal" style="--d:.05s">Pricing</span>
      <h1 class="reveal" style="--d:.12s">Transparent pricing<br>built for results<span class="dot">.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead reveal" style="--d:.22s">{{ pricing.intro }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="watermark">PRICING</div>
</section>

<!-- TIERS -->
<section class="pricing-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="pricing-grid">
      {% for tier in pricing.tiers %}
        <div class="pricing-tier{% if tier.popular %} pricing-tier-popular{% endif %} pricing-tier-{{ tier.accent }}">
          {% if tier.popular %}<div class="pricing-badge">Most Popular</div>{% endif %}
          <h3>{{ tier.name }}</h3>
          <p class="pricing-tagline">{{ tier.tagline }}</p>
          <div class="pricing-price">
            <span class="pricing-amount">{{ tier.price }}</span>
            <span class="pricing-period">{{ tier.period }}</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="pricing-features">
            {% for feature in tier.features %}
              <li><span class="pricing-check">✓</span> {{ feature }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn {% if tier.popular %}btn-lime{% else %}btn-outline{% endif %} pricing-cta">{{ tier.cta }} <span class="arr">→</span></a>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ADDONS -->
<section class="pricing-addons">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="pricing-addons-head">
      <span class="eyebrow coral">Project-Based Services</span>
      <h2>One-time projects<span class="dot">.</span></h2>
      <p>Need a brand refresh, new website, or TV spot? These project-based services can stand alone or pair with any retainer.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="addon-grid">
      {% for addon in pricing.addons %}
        <div class="addon-card">
          <h3>{{ addon.name }}</h3>
          <div class="addon-price">{{ addon.price }}</div>
          <p>{{ addon.desc }}</p>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="faq-head">
      <span class="eyebrow coral">Pricing Questions</span>
      <h2>What you might be wondering<span class="dot">.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary><span>Do you require a long-term contract?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">No. All retainers are month-to-month. We have to earn your business every month — that's the model we're proud of.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary><span>What does "ad budget management" mean?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">It's the maximum amount we'll actively manage in paid ad spend at no extra fee. Above that threshold, we add a small management percentage that's discussed up-front.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary><span>What if I need something in between tiers?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">Most clients customize their plan. Book a free strategy call and we'll scope an engagement specifically to your goals and budget.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary><span>Are setup fees included?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">For new accounts in paid media, there may be a one-time setup fee ($500-$1,500) for full restructure work. We discuss this transparently before signing.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary><span>Do you offer discounts for annual contracts?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">We don't do annual contracts because we don't believe in locking in clients. We earn renewals through performance.</div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="ctaband">
  <div class="wrap ctaband-inner">
    <div class="txt">
      <div>
        <h2>Not sure which plan is right?</h2>
        <p>Book a free strategy call. We'll help you scope the engagement that fits your goals and budget.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-lime">Book a Free Call <span class="arr">→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
